# 统一行尾,避免 Windows / macOS / Linux 之间整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 脚本按平台保留原样(launcher.cmd 必须是 CRLF)
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary

# 中文文档的 diff 更可读
*.md diff=markdown
